  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSM Solutions Expert with IOM South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Faecal Sludge Management (FSM) Solutions consultant will support the International Organization for Migration (IOM) South Sudan in its efforts to decrease the dependence on humanitarian aid in internally displaced people (IDPs) camps and sites in the Bentiu and Malakal Protection of Civilian (PoC) Site.The goal is to be achieved by identifying feasible, contextualised, safe, cost-efficient, low-maintenance durable FSM solutions for the existing infrastructure, services, and governance. A special focus will be exerted on the rehabilitation of existing FSM solutions to serve this goal. Special emphasis will also be given to solutions which can be operated autonomously and maintained by the public authorities or local service providers, in close coordination with the community. Efforts will be exerted to integrate nature-based, climate-resilient, market-based, and circular principles.</narrative>
  </description>
